# Encrypted media downloads trust only exact HTTPS origins. The built-in defaults
# are https://blossom.primal.net and https://blossom.band.
# Add origins used by your communities' or users' custom Blossom upload servers.
# Message/community metadata never automatically grants download authority.
# No paths, credentials, query strings, redirects, localhost or private IP literals.
# VITE_CONCORD_MEDIA_ORIGINS=https://media.example.com,https://blossom.example.org

# New encrypted uploads are limited to 32 MiB minus the 16-byte AES-GCM tag.
# Attachment reads allow up to 128 MiB ciphertext for older uploads; larger legacy
# attachments are unavailable. Community image reads retain the SDK's 32 MiB cap.
